# The container image for `apps/computer-host` is built with the repository
# root as its context, because the image needs `computer/host-{protocol,runtime}`
# and the module manifest alongside `apps/computer-host`. Everything else stays
# out of the context.
*
!apps/computer-host
!computer/package.json
!computer/host-protocol
!computer/host-runtime
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out
**/.wrangler
**/.dev.vars
